ng font updates and image tag modifications. I will verify the responsiveness and visual appeal across devices.\n\n\n**Automating Footer Implementation**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating the footer. I\'m leveraging automated scripting, specifically the `sed` utility, to standardize text sizes and component updates. I\'ve streamlined the process for consistent font updates, including integrating the text and image tag modifications in the footer. I am aiming to ensure the footer looks great on all screen sizes.\n\n\n"
