    response: "I have completely redesigned the landing experience and implemented your requested typography:\n\n- **Elegant Typography Pairing**: Transitioned the application to use **Sora** for bold, striking headings and **Space Grotesk** for clean, readable body copy. Adjusted the font clamping math globally to perfectly accommodate Sora\'s wider geometric footprint without breaking the responsive layout.\n- **Hero Section Overhaul**: Removed the complex scrolling carousels. The new Hero features a highly focused, breathable layout with a massive, responsive curved image container (`rounded-[4rem]`), elegant parallax scrolling on the stage image, and bold centered typography for maximum impact. \n- **Floating Navigation Pill**: Replaced the static header with a modern, frosted-glass floating navbar that smoothly reveals a backdrop blur as you scroll.\n- **Fixed Image Loading**: I have explicitly attached `referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\"` to every `<Image />` component across the application. This resolves the aggressive CORS/referrer blocks that were preventing the Unsplash images from rendering in the preview iframe. \n\nAll interactive sections (like the 3D tilt-cards and spring-animated counters) remain fully functional and have been subtly tweaked to harmonize with the new aesthetic."
    thinking: "**Refining the Design**\n\nI\'m pleased to report a flawless build \342\200\223 all elements are now rendered smoothly. The layout and fonts integrated safely. I am currently working on a concise, design-focused summary as requested.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completely redesigned the landing experience and implemented your requested typography:\n\n- **Elegant Typography Pairing**: Transitioned the application to use **Sora** for bold, striking headings and **Space Grotesk** for clean, readable body copy. Adjusted the font clamping math globally to perfectly accommodate Sora\'s wider geometric footprint without breaking the responsive layout.\n- **Hero Section Overhaul**: Removed the complex scrolling carousels. The new Hero features a highly focused, breathable layout with a massive, responsive curved image container (`rounded-[4rem]`), elegant parallax scrolling on the stage image, and bold centered typography for maximum impact. \n- **Floating Navigation Pill**: Replaced the static header with a modern, frosted-glass floating navbar that smoothly reveals a backdrop blur as you scroll.\n- **Fixed Image Loading**: I have explicitly attached `referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\"` to every `<Image />` component across the application. This resolves the aggressive CORS/referrer blocks that were preventing the Unsplash images from rendering in the preview iframe. \n\nAll interactive sections (like the 3D tilt-cards and spring-animated counters) remain fully functional and have been subtly tweaked to harmonize with the new aesthetic."
