      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHE5rv_ap1kR9dThSbaRLpidvXTVZ79RSaAdk2z4LfcjjWkbvSKtlMivV1xAa8qlnvyuhfxNM6xHsV7T-FtfZEPPw_jVLlJZBHfKN8ieGsejtmdOksm5K8L1ganGDkuVtGEsskX9vgoCWnODTcdigy1VhGHSTxgSXWE_2g6x0oPf0EVZhSVm8OM1bo="
      title: "dev.to"
    }
    summary: "The error message \"Cannot set property fetch of #<Window> which has only a getter\" indicates that you are attempting to reassign or redefine the `fetch` property on the global `window` object, which is not permitted because `window.fetch` is a read-only getter property[1][2].\n\nIn modern web browsers, the `fetch` API is a native built-in function provided by the browser environment for making network requests[3][4]. It is exposed on the `window` object as an accessor property (a getter), meaning its value is retrieved via an internal function and cannot be directly overwritten like a regular data property[1][2]. This design prevents accidental or malicious tampering with a fundamental browser API.\n\nThis error most commonly occurs in testing scenarios where developers try to mock the `fetch` API to control its behavior during tests without making actual network requests[5][6][7][8].\n\nTo resolve this issue, especially when trying to mock `fetch` for testing, consider the following approaches:\n\n*   **Use a dedicated mocking library** Libraries like `jest-fetch-mock` are specifically designed to mock the `fetch` API in testing environments (e.g., with Jest)[9][10]. These libraries provide methods to control `fetch`\'s responses and behavior without directly overwriting the `window.fetch` getter[9].\n*   **Manual mocking with `jest.fn()`** In Jest, you can manually mock the global `fetch` function by assigning a `jest.fn()` implementation that returns a resolved or rejected Promise. This approach allows you to define mock responses and assert how `fetch` was called[6][7][11]. For example:\n    \n\nSources:\n[1] [mozilla.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFF9OEvqSd1V5bwFXeFw30ZhLMxZPAmvxaMiR1yxZckiDY5R9EFbQVD_5RxmTIusnpbkC2URVxyyTWCX9-b6tkETWb1yIJhRe7Kf3fzbvSxbSJcFwbM20ryKOalFkJ-VbS9dSZRbW9xLsOXwjNOMTDRdQgPvHbJvLQL8kBDMYRqVVe-5QbXTp3ZlIE=)\n[2] [geeksforgeeks.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEcrjYkPlNhFuBteQx-Jmj_bOrZqckK1pbdRsWvwoo-Q6ewiEqmlo2Oo1dSwfd2ZYi1YLIxD8Dr4WcMAq0r9yzzKAAZ-xXcz-g_n-w9j0Zr7ycapl6HK3wSd2NIsyZvnkb83c270u_LbhNwXM-Oruf6xFhcV7ecgxUfoaMk9vccMTkbng==)\n[3] [freecodecamp.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHVaAJU9Zw2uU-w0Swceu8buppkRQex07Ua_NfUPHTNOHwGT-POo0cKFsbF9Ftn0ZgpOFgXnIlc5zlHigwT5p_CgtoSF8WbRAulNiALkaGEAcl79inBHt1ED4zrmXTbPVYducQur7sV1KMOQNXgOtmHOtds9qK-LzAvusX44hg=)\n[4] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHKLzBW_Tx96DVnv_9zX583lVuO0NLaJ0TOrQ9QtGzpHgDLEQ8602vUmtvf1UzQQzKDI9FcWI3wisWrlcCR0a37uutew35tLxiA7yeywV_9bnVKBpWONHmgd36TqCIlRaaf2yXEeJTvo05yu3IU4gLA6bcTzIo7vs7DjEP58cSVE-BEgoVtdIUBTeqURHno5FIapAFRVsg=)\n[5] [adropincalm.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF3-855ypIc2XzKqQD2c89ii1esDAjjjipqh6f48QOVKVjN5ZOcvKji7hCfBvV5ibJWDWz1No-a_1f7ZbrtnUIBp2fpdCgFbyclwI_lpbcR_GRPH6rOqW76R7ncWJ97DLLXFAr2y25Z89NTfZCUjNMCLvaV1kerpr57yhx4ZfJfRdoqul8=)\n[6] [browserstack.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGR4bE2T7OBO8tVxonggc335deWDqbD_uAmSnWlW8mZRnPplwpLxWbgEWwCtl7hePQVZ6fEODg8Oql68E2wzUMM1_q2Ft0MvziixbOaH2pRAyH5ulENyexOYw-z7I6EHW6JgMobA5gGH7JK5-42FxgOp--HARTH)\n[7] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE60VOt3IWoATBNEYdje2Bcr7IxWPcXnMnlK2WuStcJ9-aha4l9dMZ9r7CI4SODAwi492rxr8EvSs6OaPb1IZdTXq6fsJQOhmvC2OJCmesOfhv8ArpJjyUFIpaXHaqFbuHt2fZ4bfaJkqyh2QWfBlUKFLvzsucSYTK3JbOpvWf5GmaMlPpDPNKy)\n[8] [swizec.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHFOyCbCRMXJL8M8Llhyxg9TnRmEIYfIADJlUz9awPysGSEiTKsT2GA3vnXE6Yng8SA0AK5FR8lHj7DagbCpyHyKlAhC3ttF3q-7yojqy4zQ7rtG9IWNkX9eQev5vNGX5Rm79zpts6PwKeg5RNcT_xFtaD97gpvwVA-JonlpfvPDQ==)\n[9] [npmjs.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEm98DqDOi_tDsVpx6n-0b_dpogpTQ0-tHSu32EkPNEHy0UJdpq8VsJbwC98lERc-45NociTwJJ4dnrZkqoXmnM-jdHUBPYYDP