  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Investigating a Port Conflict**\n\nI\'ve hit a snag. Task 284\'s `npm run dev` failed with `EADDRINUSE 8080`, which suggests another process is hogging the port. I\'m now investigating *what* that process might be. Could it be a second instance of `next dev`? The restart tool might be related too. Time to dig deeper into the system\'s background processes.\n\n\n**Clarifying Port Issues**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the system\'s background dev server runs `npm run dev` and it was, indeed, starting on port 8080 due to the `PORT=8080` environment variable. But the reverse proxy only routes port 3000, so the preview was broken! Running `sed` and `restart_dev_server` fixed it, and now the dev server is correctly running on 3000. However, I need to investigate the `npm run build` failure with the `useContext` error at `/_not-found`. It could cause deployment issues.\n\n\n**Analyzing the Not-Found Error**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the `/_not-found` prerendering crash. I see `TypeError: Cannot read properties of null (reading \'useContext\')`, likely an issue with React context during SSR. I\'ve confirmed React is at version 19.2.1 and Next.js is at 15.1.0, and I\'ve started examining the `lucide-react` and `motion` libraries as potential culprits, although, the issue may be a missing `\'use client\'` directive in a client component using context. Now, I\'m thinking the Next.js default `not-found` page is the source of the crash, and it could be due to something in `app/layout.tsx`. I should check that file!\n\n\n\n**Examining Potential Causes**\n\nI\'m now thinking about the root cause of the error. The code snippet I\'m seeing is fine; no direct context use. I don\'t see any custom `components/ui.tsx`, and the root layout doesn\'t import anything that seems relevant. My focus has shifted back to the automatically generated `/_not-found` page. I recall that I\'ve gotten an error about importing `<Html>` outside `_document.tsx` previously. Is this related?\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 10
      nanos: 20528677
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
